WEBVTT

00:01:49.420 --> 00:01:50.330
How?

00:01:52.330 --> 00:01:54.880
How did I end up in this situation again?

00:01:55.710 --> 00:01:58.720
Episode 9

00:01:55.710 --> 00:01:58.720
I Call That Feeling Marble

00:02:00.970 --> 00:02:02.750
It's because I am Lily,

00:02:03.220 --> 00:02:04.150
Hayashi-san.

00:02:04.530 --> 00:02:05.180
Huh?

00:02:06.670 --> 00:02:09.540
So Sakurai-san is Harth-san.

00:02:09.540 --> 00:02:10.760
And Lily-san?!

00:02:11.070 --> 00:02:11.940
And...

00:02:12.300 --> 00:02:15.690
Argh! Wait, then... No! Argh!

00:02:21.260 --> 00:02:24.070
Wh-Wh-Why?

00:02:27.330 --> 00:02:30.210
Why does he know I'm Hayashi?!

00:02:30.210 --> 00:02:32.290
Wha-Wha-Wha...

00:02:34.020 --> 00:02:36.880
Sorry, I didn't mean any harm.

00:02:37.100 --> 00:02:41.060
And... I never expected this either.

00:02:41.060 --> 00:02:42.060
Um...

00:02:43.860 --> 00:02:46.890
I wasn't trying to make fun
of you or anything like that.

00:02:49.970 --> 00:02:52.340
Um... Morioka-san?

00:02:53.520 --> 00:02:54.870
Morioka-san?

00:02:56.940 --> 00:02:58.650
Um, s-sorry! So sorry!

00:02:58.650 --> 00:03:01.900
It's just, um, like the CPU
in my head is overloaded.

00:03:02.280 --> 00:03:04.170
Um, when did you find out?

00:03:05.290 --> 00:03:05.860
Huh?

00:03:08.570 --> 00:03:11.040
When did you find out I was Hayashi?

00:03:12.460 --> 00:03:16.510
Well, while talking to Hayashi-san as Lily,

00:03:16.510 --> 00:03:17.920
I started to wonder,

00:03:18.400 --> 00:03:21.380
but I didn't think there was
any way it could actually be you.

00:03:21.380 --> 00:03:23.300
I was really on the fence about it.

00:03:23.720 --> 00:03:24.810
Morioka-san!

00:03:30.280 --> 00:03:32.370
But after that night, I was sure.

00:03:33.750 --> 00:03:35.860
I-I see...

00:03:35.860 --> 00:03:37.440
Coincidences really do happen, huh?

00:03:38.280 --> 00:03:39.470
I'm sorry.

00:03:40.450 --> 00:03:43.450
No, there's no need to apologize.

00:03:44.990 --> 00:03:46.950
If I were in his position,

00:03:46.950 --> 00:03:48.640
I wonder what I would have done.

00:03:50.630 --> 00:03:52.790
Would I have rushed
to him like he did for me?

00:03:53.890 --> 00:03:56.610
No, I probably wouldn't have.

00:03:58.150 --> 00:03:59.950
It would have been hard to explain,

00:03:59.950 --> 00:04:03.890
and I'd worry about damaging our
relationship if I told him the truth.

00:04:04.450 --> 00:04:05.090
But...

00:04:06.220 --> 00:04:09.100
He ran to me so quickly
that he was out of breath.

00:04:12.270 --> 00:04:14.740
Of course she would be shocked.

00:04:15.090 --> 00:04:18.310
That I'm both Harth and Lily.

00:04:19.110 --> 00:04:19.940
I...

00:04:21.140 --> 00:04:25.360
was always happy when Hayashi-san
came to see me when I logged in.

00:04:25.360 --> 00:04:26.430
Lily-san!

00:04:26.980 --> 00:04:28.830
Hayashi-san! Good evening!

00:04:36.480 --> 00:04:39.820
I always felt really comfortable
when I got to play with you.

00:04:40.540 --> 00:04:41.780
Lily-san!

00:04:50.880 --> 00:04:54.150
Morioka-san, thank you for everything
you've done for me until today.

00:04:54.150 --> 00:04:54.980
Huh?

00:04:56.190 --> 00:04:58.600
I'll quit <i>Fruits de Mer</i>.

00:04:59.280 --> 00:04:59.940
Wha?

00:05:00.990 --> 00:05:02.610
I'm sure I've made things awkward now.

00:05:02.610 --> 00:05:05.360
I imagine this is a rather
unsavory experience for you.

00:05:05.660 --> 00:05:07.450
U-Unsavory?

00:05:07.450 --> 00:05:09.740
That's not true at all!

00:05:09.740 --> 00:05:10.440
Huh?

00:05:12.720 --> 00:05:16.570
I-It's true I asked you for all sorts
of advice without knowing who you were,

00:05:16.570 --> 00:05:18.650
so yes, I'm embarrassed
and don't know what to do,

00:05:18.650 --> 00:05:21.260
but the fact that you went out
of your way to look out for me

00:05:21.260 --> 00:05:23.020
is something I'm really grateful for.

00:05:23.770 --> 00:05:27.340
And part of the blame for why it was
so hard for you to tell me falls on me.

00:05:27.640 --> 00:05:30.670
I'm sorry for not telling you I was a woman.

00:05:30.670 --> 00:05:31.970
I'm sorry for playing a guy online.

00:05:31.970 --> 00:05:33.900
No, no! That's my line. Really!

00:05:33.900 --> 00:05:35.280
I'm sorry for not telling you sooner.

00:05:35.280 --> 00:05:36.770
And sorry for playing a girl online!

00:05:36.770 --> 00:05:38.120
No, no, I'm the one who's sorry!

00:05:38.120 --> 00:05:39.040
No, no, I'm the one!

00:05:39.040 --> 00:05:39.730
No, no, I am!

00:05:39.730 --> 00:05:40.460
No, no, I am!

00:05:40.460 --> 00:05:41.140
I am!

00:05:41.140 --> 00:05:41.980
I am!

00:05:43.360 --> 00:05:47.530
So don't think you need to disappear
to bring this to a close.

00:05:47.530 --> 00:05:50.120
I guess I just don't really feel that way.

00:05:51.350 --> 00:05:54.050
B-Besides, didn't you ask me...

00:05:54.050 --> 00:05:56.250
Lily-san asked Hayashi herself, didn't she?

00:06:00.170 --> 00:06:02.130
Would you become my partner?

00:06:02.790 --> 00:06:03.530
Right?

00:06:07.970 --> 00:06:10.510
Lily-san and Hayashi are partners.

00:06:13.940 --> 00:06:16.520
So I'd like...

00:06:21.170 --> 00:06:24.020
for us to keep being good online friends.

00:06:24.380 --> 00:06:25.330
But...

00:06:27.830 --> 00:06:30.060
is that okay?

00:06:30.530 --> 00:06:32.080
Well...

00:06:33.840 --> 00:06:34.990
I'm happy.

00:06:38.840 --> 00:06:43.540
And if that's what makes you happy,
I look forward to playing with you again.

00:06:51.090 --> 00:06:54.050
I'm, um, sorry about all the trouble today.

00:06:54.520 --> 00:06:57.310
Your coat and scarf were very warm.

00:06:58.020 --> 00:07:00.310
You even gave me food.

00:07:03.630 --> 00:07:05.570
I'll walk you home.

00:07:05.570 --> 00:07:08.160
No, it's okay. I'm already almost there.

00:07:09.390 --> 00:07:10.520
I see.

00:07:12.300 --> 00:07:14.580
See you later then.

00:07:14.580 --> 00:07:16.380
Y-Yeah.

00:07:23.830 --> 00:07:25.630
S-Sakurai-san!

00:07:26.990 --> 00:07:28.590
Um...

00:07:28.960 --> 00:07:30.700
When you have some free time,

00:07:30.700 --> 00:07:33.720
I'd like you to help me with
my class change quest again.

00:07:33.720 --> 00:07:34.700
So, well...

00:07:35.890 --> 00:07:37.950
I can't promise anything on weekdays,

00:07:37.950 --> 00:07:40.600
but I'll do my best to make sure we
can play together on the weekend.

00:07:41.360 --> 00:07:42.850
G-Great!

00:07:43.350 --> 00:07:46.190
Thank you for always making time
for me in your busy schedule.

00:07:46.190 --> 00:07:48.230
Um, goodnight!

00:07:57.120 --> 00:07:59.680
I know she said all that.

00:08:02.470 --> 00:08:05.250
I'd like for us to keep
being good online friends.

00:08:05.840 --> 00:08:06.700
But I...

00:08:37.220 --> 00:08:40.090
It's been days since he said
he'd log in on Saturday,

00:08:40.090 --> 00:08:41.910
but I still haven't seen him online.

00:08:45.260 --> 00:08:47.290
I wonder if he's busy at work.

00:08:48.630 --> 00:08:49.730
Or maybe...

00:08:53.200 --> 00:08:55.560
It's hard to send an email or call him.

00:08:56.430 --> 00:08:59.930
I'm still enjoying my MMO, but I feel lonely.

00:09:11.770 --> 00:09:16.240
I guess it really was too much for
us to go in there without a healer.

00:09:16.240 --> 00:09:17.070
No.

00:09:17.480 --> 00:09:20.080
We were doing pretty well when we started.

00:09:20.080 --> 00:09:22.560
Jeez, what are you spacing out for?!

00:09:23.700 --> 00:09:25.080
Did you fall asleep?

00:09:25.450 --> 00:09:28.580
I'm sorry. That's not it.

00:09:29.410 --> 00:09:31.280
I just got lost in thought.

00:09:32.660 --> 00:09:35.300
Is something bothering you again?

00:09:35.300 --> 00:09:37.750
No, not at all! Nope! Nope!

00:09:37.750 --> 00:09:39.300
So there is.

00:09:47.580 --> 00:09:50.060
Well, if you feel like talking
about it, let us know.

00:09:50.640 --> 00:09:53.300
If you can settle for us, we're all ears.

00:09:53.300 --> 00:09:56.570
S-Sure. Thank you very much.

00:10:03.440 --> 00:10:06.300
I wonder if this has
something to do with Lily...

00:10:07.430 --> 00:10:09.690
...and her not logging in lately.

00:10:10.760 --> 00:10:12.770
Bet it does.

00:10:14.880 --> 00:10:17.220
MMOs really are the best.

00:10:17.970 --> 00:10:20.220
They're so warm and caring.

00:10:21.910 --> 00:10:26.790
But given the circumstances,
there's no way I can ask them about it.

00:10:29.920 --> 00:10:33.140
Sakura-chan, what's the matter?
Reached your limit already?

00:10:35.480 --> 00:10:39.740
Come on! TGIF! The night's still young!

00:10:40.000 --> 00:10:42.430
What's "TGIF"?

00:10:42.740 --> 00:10:47.000
"Thank God it's Friday."
You don't know it? Come on, now.

00:10:50.240 --> 00:10:52.450
Say cheese! Look here!

00:10:52.450 --> 00:10:53.710
No.

00:10:54.000 --> 00:10:55.840
No need to be shy.

00:10:55.840 --> 00:10:57.580
I'm not shy.

00:10:58.010 --> 00:11:02.230
Still, it's pretty rare for you to
drink until you're drop dead drunk.

00:11:04.510 --> 00:11:07.970
If something's bothering you, why not
ask your big brother here for help?

00:11:08.530 --> 00:11:10.000
Is it a game?

00:11:10.000 --> 00:11:13.020
<i>Fruits de Mer</i> was fun.
Let's play again sometime.

00:11:14.040 --> 00:11:16.030
Is it work?

00:11:16.030 --> 00:11:17.360
Someone giving you trouble?

00:11:17.360 --> 00:11:19.090
Or could it be love?

00:11:19.970 --> 00:11:21.780
I got rejected.

00:11:21.780 --> 00:11:22.530
Huh?

00:11:36.420 --> 00:11:39.420
Could it be Sakurai-san?

00:11:46.930 --> 00:11:48.430
Koiwai-san?

00:11:49.630 --> 00:11:51.440
"You free tomorrow?"

00:11:52.010 --> 00:11:54.900
There's something I'd like
to talk to you about.

00:11:54.900 --> 00:11:56.110
Can we meet up?

00:11:56.700 --> 00:11:57.730
To talk?

00:12:18.790 --> 00:12:21.470
How did I get home?

00:12:21.750 --> 00:12:23.950
I remember drinking with Koiwai-san...

00:12:24.400 --> 00:12:25.470
And then... nothing.

00:12:27.140 --> 00:12:29.540
Guess I really drank too much.

00:12:42.740 --> 00:12:45.740
Dear Sakura-chan,
Morning! Did you sleep well?
When you wake up, come to the park.
I'll be waiting!
-Koiwai

00:13:02.270 --> 00:13:04.350
Koiwai-san sure is late.

00:13:09.500 --> 00:13:12.770
Koiwai-san, did you take me home?

00:13:12.770 --> 00:13:17.020
Sure did. You were dead drunk.
It was a real hassle!

00:13:17.020 --> 00:13:20.360
I carried you like a princess and gently
laid you on your bed and everything.

00:13:20.360 --> 00:13:25.200
Um, I don't really remember anything.

00:13:26.030 --> 00:13:28.990
I didn't, um... do anything, do I?

00:13:29.530 --> 00:13:33.540
What is it you're worried you did,
huh? Something dirty?

00:13:33.970 --> 00:13:36.130
I would never!

00:13:37.540 --> 00:13:41.900
No worries. You just said
something you normally wouldn't.

00:13:42.810 --> 00:13:44.870
Something I normally wouldn't?

00:13:44.870 --> 00:13:45.990
What's that?

00:13:46.550 --> 00:13:48.340
It's a secret.

00:13:50.770 --> 00:13:54.060
Well, when I woke up, I found this note
about the park. What's going on?

00:13:54.060 --> 00:13:56.590
Why don't you come and find out?

00:13:56.590 --> 00:13:57.250
Later!

00:13:58.070 --> 00:13:58.810
Wait!

00:13:59.520 --> 00:14:00.480
Jeez.

00:14:16.520 --> 00:14:19.210
Koiwai-san should be around here, right?

00:14:37.840 --> 00:14:40.790
Um, I'm here because Koiwai-san...

00:14:43.160 --> 00:14:45.180
Hey!

00:14:49.700 --> 00:14:52.620
Jeez, they sure keep me busy.

00:14:53.570 --> 00:14:56.740
Guess it's time to leave things
in the hands of those youngsters.

00:15:01.890 --> 00:15:05.800
I wonder how she'd react if
I showed her this right now.

00:15:08.820 --> 00:15:11.160
I'll just have to save it
to tease her with later.

00:15:26.850 --> 00:15:30.070
I-I wonder if I look weird today.

00:15:32.030 --> 00:15:33.570
What do I do?

00:15:34.210 --> 00:15:37.470
I wish I'd dressed up a little more.

00:15:38.770 --> 00:15:40.190
Morioka-san...

00:15:42.840 --> 00:15:45.750
I'd like for us to keep
being good online friends.

00:15:46.080 --> 00:15:47.780
I know she said that,

00:15:47.780 --> 00:15:51.910
but things were just so awkward
that I couldn't log in all week.

00:15:57.600 --> 00:15:59.270
I-I'm sorry!

00:16:02.320 --> 00:16:05.230
Each and every time,
I'm so embarrassed I could die!

00:16:16.300 --> 00:16:18.600
You're always hungry.

00:16:18.600 --> 00:16:21.630
I-I guess that's just who I am.

00:16:23.120 --> 00:16:25.370
I haven't eaten anything today either.

00:16:25.740 --> 00:16:27.750
How about we pick up something light to eat?

00:16:28.090 --> 00:16:29.880
S-Sure.

00:16:35.250 --> 00:16:38.640
If Kanbe—Fujimoto-san is there,
I wonder what he'll think

00:16:38.640 --> 00:16:41.020
about Sakurai-san and I coming together.

00:16:41.670 --> 00:16:44.520
I wonder if Sakurai-san knows Fujimoto-san.

00:16:45.070 --> 00:16:46.330
He does live close by.

00:16:47.930 --> 00:16:49.460
Welcome.

00:16:56.770 --> 00:16:58.660
Looks like Fujimoto-san isn't here.

00:16:58.660 --> 00:16:59.890
Morioka-san.

00:16:59.890 --> 00:17:00.740
C-Coming!

00:17:01.280 --> 00:17:02.630
What should we get?

00:17:02.630 --> 00:17:04.060
Um...

00:17:04.540 --> 00:17:06.200
Goodness, Sakurai-san.

00:17:06.200 --> 00:17:08.040
Thanks for always coming by.

00:17:08.040 --> 00:17:09.230
Oh, you're welcome.

00:17:09.230 --> 00:17:10.640
Is today your day off?

00:17:10.640 --> 00:17:15.170
Oh, you too, miss.
Thanks for always coming by.

00:17:15.170 --> 00:17:17.550
Crap, so she does recognize me.

00:17:17.550 --> 00:17:19.320
Y-You're welcome.

00:17:19.860 --> 00:17:21.370
She's totally looking staring!

00:17:21.370 --> 00:17:22.670
Y-Yashiro-san?

00:17:22.670 --> 00:17:25.560
Oh, don't mind me. I was just wondering...

00:17:25.960 --> 00:17:29.190
She isn't your girlfriend, is she?

00:17:33.570 --> 00:17:37.190
What? Girlfriend? It's nothing like that.

00:17:37.190 --> 00:17:40.590
He and I just happen to be... um...

00:17:40.590 --> 00:17:42.490
If you'll excuse me!

00:17:42.490 --> 00:17:43.320
Morioka-san!

00:17:43.320 --> 00:17:44.330
Huh?

00:17:44.330 --> 00:17:46.640
Sorry, Yashiro-san. I'll be going, too!

00:17:52.450 --> 00:17:55.080
G-Goodness... Come again!

00:17:57.280 --> 00:17:58.950
Good morning.

00:17:58.950 --> 00:18:00.700
It looks like it's going to rain.

00:18:01.850 --> 00:18:04.330
Fujimoto-kun!

00:18:04.650 --> 00:18:05.870
What happened?

00:18:06.340 --> 00:18:10.090
Actually, you know Sakurai-san, right?

00:18:10.090 --> 00:18:12.110
Oh, yeah. That blond man?

00:18:12.110 --> 00:18:16.110
Sakurai-san came in together with
that woman who's always in here!

00:18:16.110 --> 00:18:19.110
The woman who's always here?

00:18:23.420 --> 00:18:26.620
Her, right? She was with a guy?

00:18:27.190 --> 00:18:31.670
So maybe Hayashi wasn't behaving
strangely because of Lily,

00:18:31.670 --> 00:18:33.130
but because of this?

00:18:33.390 --> 00:18:35.310
I don't get it at all!

00:18:35.310 --> 00:18:39.530
Goodness, Fujimoto-kun, are you okay?
I'm counting on you to take over at the register.

00:18:53.650 --> 00:18:55.230
Oh, don't mind me.

00:18:55.230 --> 00:18:57.110
I was just wondering...

00:18:57.110 --> 00:18:59.530
She isn't your girlfriend, is she?

00:19:01.100 --> 00:19:05.190
She really meant, "There's no way a girl like that is your girlfriend, right?" Didn't she?

00:19:09.740 --> 00:19:10.920
Morioka-san!

00:19:11.090 --> 00:19:12.440
Sorry.

00:19:12.440 --> 00:19:17.290
Everyone will look at you funny
if you're with someone like me.

00:19:20.230 --> 00:19:24.140
I mean, usually, I look like a complete mess.

00:19:29.370 --> 00:19:30.470
Hey...

00:19:30.470 --> 00:19:33.940
I'm a NEET, after all. I can
see why she'd be suspicious.

00:19:33.000 --> 00:19:33.970
Hey.

00:19:34.290 --> 00:19:37.310
I'm not the kind of person who
should be with someone like you.

00:19:37.310 --> 00:19:39.790
I'm sorry for embarrassing you like—

00:19:39.030 --> 00:19:39.790
Hey!

00:19:42.780 --> 00:19:45.280
I don't feel that way at all.

00:19:45.770 --> 00:19:46.800
Really.

00:19:51.620 --> 00:19:53.840
M-M-Morioka-san?!

00:20:07.870 --> 00:20:10.030
We should find some cover.

00:20:15.620 --> 00:20:17.080
I know.

00:20:17.080 --> 00:20:18.980
My place is nearby.

00:20:18.980 --> 00:20:20.940
Why not come over and get out of the rain?

00:20:24.210 --> 00:20:25.870
A-And...

00:20:25.870 --> 00:20:28.060
We left without buying anything, right?

00:20:28.060 --> 00:20:30.510
I'll make some lunch, so come over for a bite.

00:20:31.890 --> 00:20:32.520
All right?

00:20:42.160 --> 00:20:45.490
I brought her here without
thinking. What now?

00:20:46.210 --> 00:20:49.650
I came over without thinking. What now?

00:20:50.910 --> 00:20:52.980
W-W-Well, c-come in.

00:20:52.980 --> 00:20:54.330
S-Sure!

00:21:18.890 --> 00:21:20.200
Is this okay?

00:21:20.840 --> 00:21:22.340
Is it too big?

00:21:32.850 --> 00:21:35.350
What am I doing?!

00:21:38.900 --> 00:21:40.680
M-Morioka-san!

00:21:42.120 --> 00:21:44.750
I-I'll leave a towel and
a change of clothes here.

00:21:44.750 --> 00:21:47.570
I'm not sure they'll fit, but give them a try.

00:21:47.570 --> 00:21:49.750
Th-Thank you very much.

00:21:50.870 --> 00:21:53.860
What am I gonna do about the mood here?

00:23:24.960 --> 00:23:40.210
Next Episode

00:23:25.240 --> 00:23:27.970
What am I doing?

00:23:27.970 --> 00:23:29.720
I'm so happy

00:23:29.720 --> 00:23:31.590
that I met you, Morioka-san.

00:23:31.780 --> 00:23:33.260
I didn't mean to cry.

00:23:33.260 --> 00:23:35.640
What's wrong? Did you have a fight?

00:23:35.140 --> 00:23:40.190
Episode 10
On a Moonlit Evening

00:23:35.640 --> 00:23:38.930
Episode 10, "On a Moonlit Evening."
